{"title": "Prophecy: Well-Read (Condition)", "pageid": 34430, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Prophecy:_Well-Read_(Condition)", "categories": ["Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Utility Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Prophecy: Well-Read</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Learning from or using a <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll\" title=\"Scroll\">Spell Scroll</a> will result in a new <a href=\"/wiki/Portent\" title=\"Portent\">Portent Die</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DIVINATION_SCROLL_LEARN</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DIVINATION_SCROLL_LEARN+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DIVINATION_SCROLL_LEARN+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of the randomly selected prophecies to fulfill from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Expert_Divination\" title=\"Expert Divination\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/25px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/38px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/50px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Expert Divination\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp/25px-Expert_Divination_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f4/Expert_Divination_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Expert_Divination\" title=\"Expert Divination\">Expert Divination</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This prophecy can only be fulfilled for learning a spell from scroll when done via inventory. Spells learnt in 'Learn More Spells' window do not work.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Prophecy:_Well-Read\">Sources of Prophecy: Well-Read</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-conditio